ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Me ha pasado algo muy fuerte.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Resulta que tengo una cosa
pasada de moda en mi casa.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡No puede seguir ahí, es{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006500020061000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} tiene
que desaparecer, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
¿Por qué no me buscas un sustituto
que sea del mismo tamaño?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Casa mia è troppo indietro!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Tutte le mie amiche hanno mobili{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
supertrendy. Che vergogna!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Per esempio, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}non sopporto più{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD0C0069006C0020006D0069006F000C006C00610020006D006900610002003000}} {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ora
cerco un {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}mobile {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}altrettanto grande.
Deve occupare lo stesso spazio.
Mi aiuteresti, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Evim resmen geçmişte takılı kalmış!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Dekorasyona dayanamıyorum artık.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Bir şeyleri sarsmam lazım!
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} değişebilir{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}ama yerine aynı
boyda bir şey koymam gerekir.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Parlak bir fikrin varsa bana söyle!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Je suis partie dans un délire déco...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
On peut plus m'arrêter,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !
J'ai {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
chez moi qui va pas tarder à aller
rejoindre ses copains à la poubelle...
Si tu pouvais lui trouver {{TAG:000E:0008:00CD040075006E00060075006E00650002003000}}
{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD1400720065006D0070006C006100E70061006E0074001600720065006D0070006C006100E70061006E007400650002003000}}, ça m'arrangerait. Ça
va faire vide sinon, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Son zamanlarda duvarlara biraz daha
ışıltı lazım diye düşünüyorum, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Evet, duvar kâğıdı tek başına yetmiyor.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Asacak bir şey bulur musun? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Raf,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
aydınlatma,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} ne olursa!

FR:
Franchement, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Qu'est-ce tu penses de ma déco ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
C'est pas top, je suis d'accord...
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Un bon gros meuble, bien massif,
voilà ce qui manque, {{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Si tu tombes sur la perche rare,
pense à ta meilleure copine, OK ?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Stavo pensando che {{TAG:000E:0008:00CD0C0069006C0020006D0069006F000C006C00610020006D006900610002003000}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} non è
proprio il massimo per 'sta stanza.
Voglio un {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}mobile{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} per rimpiazzarl{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006F000200610002003000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Qualsiasi {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}mobile {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}della stessa misura
e mille volte più trendy.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Mi dai una mano tu, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Se trovi qualcosa di interessante,
portamelo!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ho letto che la carta da parati non
è più abbastanza per decorare
le pareti, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Se voglio essere alla moda, devo
avere un oggetto da appendere,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Aiutami tu! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Uno scaffale,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
un orologio, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}qualsiasi cosa!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Cioè, mi fido di te!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hey, buradaki {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
sence nasıl?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Duvarda öylece asılı durması
fazla sıkıcı, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Değiştirmek istiyorum!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yerine asabileceğim bir şey bulmama
yardım etsene, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I know you must think my home is
super stylish and everything,
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}But there's something missing.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
I just don't know what it is.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I wonder.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}can you help me?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yeah, I bet you can! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}You've got a
great sense of style, like I do!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Find something for my room, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}OK?
